  "solution": {
    "text": "Electron releasing groups (Alkyl groups) de stabilizes conjugate base.\nThe $+$ I effect of $\\mathrm{C}_3 \\mathrm{H}_7$ is less than $-1$ effect of $\\mathrm{Cl}$\n$\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a}}$ of $\\mathrm{HCOOH}$ is $17.9 \\times 10^{-5}$\n$\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a}}$ of $\\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{CH}_2 \\underset{\\mathrm{Cl}}{\\mathrm{CH}}-\\mathrm{COOH}$ is $139 \\times 10^{-5}$",
